  "title": "Data Center Trends 2025: Vertiv predicts industry efforts to support, enable, leverage, and regulate AI",
  "summary": "AI continues to reshape the data center industry, a reality reflected in the projected 2025 data center trends from Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions. Vertiv experts anticipate increased industry innovation and integration to support high-density computing, regulatory scrutiny around AI, as well as increasing focus on sustainability and cybersecurity efforts.",
